              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku kanuena nuona buloba bunudi nushikamamu, bualu bua mashi adi ona buloba, kabena bamanye mua kuhikula buloba hakamata mashi, anu ku mashi a muntu wakamatshisha mashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
