              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanuonyi buloba bunudi nushikamamu, kundi mushikame kabidi, bualu bua meme Yehowa ndi mushikame munkatshi mua Bena Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
